WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:04.650
First: a preview feature is in your plan.

3
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.137
What is its G C C availability
in the guide's table?

4
00:00:08.137 --> 00:00:12.458
The answer is b: not yet specified,
because the G C C column rests on

5
00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:17.187
Learn's product-wide sentence, and
that doesn't cover preview features.

6
00:00:17.187 --> 00:00:21.350
Second: why does the guide run Step
twelve's logging before Step three?

7
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.588
The answer is b: so the logs
exist before anything is enforced,

8
00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:29.063
and every later Validate
step has a record to read.

9
00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:34.030
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
